{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:A15-25","page_type":"section"},"citation":"A15-25","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","content_hash":"be83029f594b21b659e598d76f22f06696e5ca3dbd264c210b26137c0821178e","heading":"Sec. A15-25. Purposes for which moneys in fund may be used.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","text":"The moneys on deposit in the transient guest tax fund, subject to lawful budget appropriations, may be used for the following purposes:\n(1) To contract with any agency, organization or group of firms to promote conventions and tourism within the city and its environs;\n(2) To provide for the operation, maintenance, expansion or development of city facilities connected with conventions and tourism;\n(3) To defray the cost of providing municipal services to convention and tourism functions, including police, fire, street department or park and recreation department functions;\n(4) To create innovative projects and activities promoting conventions and tourism;\n(5) To promote the general economic welfare of the city and its environs, including the attraction of industry. (C.O. 69 § 11, 9-23-86.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"a0d8e7fd-ba5e-5f97-9f69-f72cec7f9811"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"A15-25","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","content_hash":"d451639e406a81057a0eee014f7a68642ce90cb6076536ace4325b95c076b911","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","text":"The moneys on deposit in the transient guest tax fund, subject to lawful budget appropriations, may be used for the following purposes:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"eb627865-d6e1-5e7c-949f-3011091372e5"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"A15-25","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","content_hash":"6f199058412ae3a46b996f9c2a1b9f4822fe76fbbe2a96ed4abc0d0a2108605f","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","text":"(1) To contract with any agency, organization or group of firms to promote conventions and tourism within the city and its environs;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4d20aa0a-566a-5132-87ce-aaa571539754"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"A15-25","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","content_hash":"75efedda5d2b8206d7dc71322758fad5fcde663e8982517ff8a89736a3470a5b","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","text":"(2) To provide for the operation, maintenance, expansion or development of city facilities connected with conventions and tourism;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"fa2c9345-3b0d-5ae5-be24-4d2611f44b07"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"A15-25","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","content_hash":"151414794efcc52ee7142c0774d469a49a985fec119f40a2dfb2240280b86ec1","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","text":"(3) To defray the cost of providing municipal services to convention and tourism functions, including police, fire, street department or park and recreation department functions;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4add127e-bb95-52dc-b4f2-30a940e68b9c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"A15-25","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","content_hash":"f2e15c0ebda0b5258732442e900be72c03087aa50c620a1de645161a43447173","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","text":"(4) To create innovative projects and activities promoting conventions and tourism;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"724126c4-a7a4-56e1-9a2f-ee21a09b4fa6"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"A15-25","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","content_hash":"7460891c280eb77fdd4fd0e1a5942f3c1d5bbb547ed3e83037aa5f627b90b8c9","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A15-25","text":"(5) To promote the general economic welfare of the city and its environs, including the attraction of industry. (C.O. 69 § 11, 9-23-86.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"ac983279-bf69-55f7-9bde-5137b554fff7"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a15-25:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}